{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060731/block/singleImage/3250927/wm/01M60MMCNF683QHFKJCFXYQ0GA.jpeg?updatedAt=1793170924\"/><figcaption>土瓜灣東海大廈單位起火，疑因租務糾紛遭反鎖縱火。(《am730》記者攝)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (28 日 ) 上午 11 時 37 分，警方接獲報案，指土瓜灣北帝街 64-66 號東海大廈一單位內疑發生租務糾紛，有人反鎖單位內並焚燒單位物品。 消防到場出動一喉一煙帽隊救火，約 17 分鐘後將火救熄，單位內一名男住戶清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院作進一步檢查。警方經調查後，發現單位一道木門受損，案件暫列「縱火」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:55.538893+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:02:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:10.769072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:38:31.054826+00:00","content_hash":"57b4235b1b417b4aa89cdaf9e420db6774c22fa3f16b3fdf8aec1fc0797ad422","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:41:55.538893+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}